            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91039605?u=75d9215ac93cf8524615e7259f3f7ec619bc564e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Weekly spelling check <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3328777081\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40768\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40768/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40768\">#40768</a></h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Made a few Typo fixes across the index.md files of MDN Web Docs.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the file -&gt; files/en-us/web/api/rtcinboundrtpstreamstats/totalinterframedelay/index.md  --&gt; \"variance be calculated\" to \"variance can be calculated\".</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the file -&gt; files/en-us/web/html/reference/elements/label/index.md  --&gt;  \"the starting and ending tag are mandatory\" to \"the starting and ending tags are mandatory\".</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the file -&gt; files/en-us/mozilla/firefox/index.md  --&gt;  \"cutting edge\"  to  \"cutting-edge;\" and \"open source project\" to \"open-source project\".</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the file -&gt; files/en-us/mdn/index.md. --&gt; No typos found.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For clarity , accuracy and to improve the technical precision and to give the readers a clean and unambiguous reference.</p>",
